WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:03.606
1. Sign in with your own salesperson account. This demonstration uses TEST DATA ONLY.

2
00:00:03.606 --> 00:00:07.118
2. Open Assigned Leads. Search existing records before starting an application.

3
00:00:07.118 --> 00:00:10.833
3. Use SAFER / FMCSA to verify the carrier. No USDOT is invented for this test lead.

4
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.607
4. Record an inbound conversation and notes. Outbound calling stays blocked until DNC clearance.

5
00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:18.300
5. Confirm company, contact, equipment, drivers, services and membership. Save a draft to resume later.

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.994
6. Complete the application and generate an itemized quote. Unknown fees remain pending.

7
00:00:21.994 --> 00:00:25.650
7. OWNER STEP (simulated): verify unresolved fees, record the scope and approve the exact quote.

8
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.211
8. Send the secure checkout link. Customer enters card details on Stripe. Here, no email or session is created.

9
00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:32.771
9. SIMULATED verified server payment closes the sale and queues the welcome invitation. Redirect alone is not proof.

10
00:00:32.771 --> 00:00:36.431
10. Review the completed sale and revenue. Training totals are synthetic; no real account or charge exists.

11
00:00:36.431 --> 00:00:40.116
11. Review Activity and follow up. In production, confirm delivery and customer setup; never create a duplicate.
